 "text": "REPRISE\nAI\nTHE AI BUSINESS GROWTH PLAN\nWork with us\nYOUR BUSINESS. YOUR STARTING POINT.\nGet your free\npersonalized AI roadmap to buy back your time.\n\nChoose the work you want off your plate. Get a practical workflow, the first change to test, and a brief you can hand to your team or Reprise.\n\nBuild my free growth plan\n\n100+ businesses have implemented AI with Reprise, across many industries.\n\nPersonalized to your answers\nPrivate link by email\nYOUR PRIVATE GROWTH PLAN\n01 Starting point\n02 What to fix\n03 What improves\n04 Next steps\nEXAMPLE · CLIENT INTAKE\nStop chasing the same\nmissing information.\n\nA proposed workflow, with the approval\npoint kept in a person’s hands.\n\n01\nCollect inputs\n02\nSuggest fields\n03\nA person approves\n04\nCreate the task\nYOUR FIRST MOVE\n\nTest a missing-items checklist on one complete intake and one incomplete intake.\n\nNext: what to fix\nFour short pages. One clear direction.\nFind your starting point\n\nKnow whether to map the work, pilot a workflow, or fix an unreliable system first.\n\nKnow what to change\n\nGet specific checks for the problem you selected, with a first action for your team.\n\nChoose how to move forward\n\nUse the plan yourself, or talk with Reprise about scoping and building the right workflow.\n\nREPRISE CLIENT FEEDBACK\nIn their own words.\n\nDifferent businesses. Different workflows.\n\nSee more client feedback\n\nFind the right starting point for your business.\nBuild my free growth plan\n© 2026 Reprise AI\nPrivacy\nTerms\nContact",
